{"id":"aadc5df21ecc6ba2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-term.md","title":"First-Order Term","display":"df-first-order-term — First-Order Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-term","aliases":["93-df-first-order-term"],"display":"df-first-order-term — First-Order Term","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-term — First-Order Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(F=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_F=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\alpha_F=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> is the collision-free tagged constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>; function-symbol arities are read from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTerm}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTm}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{93},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k+1}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t):f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\bar t\\in(\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L))^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTm}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{93},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k+1}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t):f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\bar t\\in(\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L))^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{FOTm}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTerm}_{93}(t;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOTerm}_{93}(t;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(x;\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(x;\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing&amp;&amp; (x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\mathcal L),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\mathcal L)&amp;&amp; (f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(x;\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(x;\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing&amp;&amp; (x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\mathcal L),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\mathcal L)&amp;&amp; (f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion on the term stages uniquely determines both support functions. Constants are the arity-zero instances and therefore have empty variable support.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the collision-free tagged constructor of [[93-df-term]]; function-symbol arities are read from $\\mathcal L$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_F=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{App